  "id": "dallas",
  "intro": "Dallas–Fort Worth is aviation on a scale that is hard to grasp until you listen to it. DFW alone has seven runways and is one of the busiest airports on earth, Love Field sits inside the city, Alliance is a dedicated freight and maintenance field, and the Metroplex has more general aviation traffic than most countries. The terrain is table-flat for a hundred miles in every direction, so VHF behaves beautifully. Spring brings the most violent weather in the United States, and the storm-spotter nets that go with it.",
  "introz": "达拉斯—沃思堡的航空规模，不亲耳听过很难理解。仅 DFW 一座机场就有七条跑道，是全球最繁忙的机场之一；爱田机场在市区内；联盟机场专营货运和维修；整个双城都会区的通用航空流量超过多数国家。地形在各个方向一百六十公里内都平如桌面，VHF 表现极佳。春天带来全美最猛烈的天气，以及随之而来的风暴观测网。",
